{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-131","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-tourn-131"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816650-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-131","missionId":"event-tourn-131","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「이봐! 여기가 어디야? 왜 내 머릿속에서 이렇게 많은 사람이 논쟁을 벌이고 있지?」 질문을 던지는 동시에 깊은 분노가 끓어오른다. 당신은 모든 것을 파괴하고 찢어버리고 싶다","talkId":403816650,"textHash":"10856650417037117316","source":"tournHandBookEvent:131/talk-403816650","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"95f37e396dadc0d8","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816651-line"],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14337","bwikiMission":"배양판"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816651-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-131","missionId":"event-tourn-131","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 지금 의식 한 줄기, 완벽한 학자의 의식 한 줄기이다. 귓가에 지식학회 학자들의 논쟁이 끝없이 맴돈다. 미래, 혼돈, 진화, 언어. 그들의 중얼거림이 들리지만, 그것들은 아무 의미가 없다","talkId":403816651,"textHash":"7609029979047065480","source":"tournHandBookEvent:131/talk-403816651","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"95f37e396dadc0d8","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816652-line"],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14337","bwikiMission":"배양판"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816652-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-131","missionId":"event-tourn-131","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"학회에서 역대 가장 우수한 학자들을 데이터로 추출해 유일한 모형으로 응집시킨다. 그들이 예측하는 최고의 결과는 지식학회 최초의 완벽한 학자가 탄생하는 것이다","talkId":403816652,"textHash":"9971085413110551149","source":"tournHandBookEvent:131/talk-403816652","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"95f37e396dadc0d8","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816653-line"],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14337","bwikiMission":"배양판"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-talk-403816653-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-131","missionId":"event-tourn-131","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"수석 학사가 실험을 가동하자, 새로운 전류가 의식 속에서 솟구친다","talkId":403816653,"textHash":"3449858978568165900","source":"tournHandBookEvent:131/talk-403816653","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"95f37e396dadc0d8","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14337","bwikiMission":"배양판"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-text-4212889095462125147-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-131","missionId":"event-tourn-131","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"이성을 건드린다","talkId":null,"textHash":"4212889095462125147","source":"tournHandBookEvent:131/text-4212889095462125147","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a8f48f57d6377c13","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-text-10242747397491776765-effect"],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14337","bwikiMission":"배양판"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-131-text-10242747397491776765-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-131","missionId":"event-tourn-131","mission":"배양판","scene":"배양판","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"일정 확률로 ★3 기물을 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"10242747397491776765","source":"tournHandBookEvent:131/text-10242747397491776765","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a8f48f57d6377c13","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"培养皿","bwikiRevision":95895,"bwikiMissionId":